OL,3,AGavin and Stacey props to be auctioned
OL,4,Afor cancer charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FFans of Gavin and Stacey will be given
OL,7,Fthe chance to get their hands on
OL,8,F"really cool, one-off pieces of
OL,9,Fmemorabilia" from the filming of the
OL,10,Fmuch-loved TV show's 2024 finale.
OL,12,FItems include the West Ham football
OL,13,Fshirts worn by James Corden, Rob Brydon
OL,14,Fand Mathew Horne at Smithy's stag do
OL,15,Fand a clapperboard signed by the cast
OL,16,Fof the BBC sitcom.
OL,18,FSome 12.3 million people watched the
OL,19,Fshow's hotly anticipated cliffhanger
OL,20,Ffinale on Christmas Day in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
